{"manifest":"{\"format\":1,\"version\":\"5.0.5\",\"notes\":\"5.0.5 — Kovan beta 0.1.1: League Asistanı (profil, derece ve LP geçmişi, maç kartları, şampiyon ve takım arkadaşı istatistikleri, karşı seçim; kendi teması) + kategori sayfaları (kenar çubuğunda yalnız Home ve 4 kategori; araçlar kategori sayfasında). Veriyi League istemcisinden yalnızca okur, bu bilgisayarda saklar. Windows'ta ve gerçek istemciyle denenmedi.\",\"minLoader\":1,\"created\":\"2026-11-03T20:07:31.637Z\",\"files\":{\"StatScan.html\":{\"sha256\":\"9a2ddbd10d123219ffc374c18de2f538c160eeab79590fd1ed15960ee6714a24\",\"size\":1368551},\"desktop/app.js\":{\"sha256\":\"53dbdbb7ea410ef4efc8bdd6f6ba3f5343ef85708771128b48afb74756468c51\",\"size\":12999},\"desktop/assets/icon.ico\":{\"sha256\":\"b0d623d0b828bcf7603ee02ac7b5cc8e9b27b13fdb5c3eff548f2cb7b7963543\",\"size\":372526},\"desktop/assets/icon.png\":{\"sha256\":\"6ce7c330fdcf2d8785ba7ea16895cc376bfbb22b4ee061da7a0692002c3ca376\",\"size\":99730},\"desktop/host.js\":{\"sha256\":\"55b27a9502a55db86ac9fb59e33a60a09f71268084fca61301f52209e1e3e95d\",\"size\":280074},\"desktop/preload.js\":{\"sha256\":\"a399c7a9dc638b1198b7485eb79e353da38da1f0bbc9134fc54fbb9bab4796f3\",\"size\":7542},\"dyn/collector.ps1\":{\"sha256\":\"3329b8cdf5257002b1f0fbe10bbc0da8ed09103d33ff67618ab8d897a61b71cb\",\"size\":39356},\"dyn/README-dinamik.md\":{\"sha256\":\"da91e62f58ce365cdec59c1ec4b689c8cf0412e742c1ea728d8ba09394485b0d\",\"size\":7201},\"dyn/statscan-dyn.js\":{\"sha256\":\"bfc3f746e061f22ae93f36968e0952f2162470b39534a2d3f8c6489795b0f883\",\"size\":115235}}}","sig":"ntBT33Y5FAbA5l9Q93VahW66yghQLKl3OxnyRgzWnqDgzdK+MEqBRt2euBul00XdUnx/kiM+6mQ5U3siHnB2Dg==","data":{"StatScan.html":"","desktop/app.js":"","desktop/assets/icon.ico":"","desktop/assets/icon.png":"","desktop/host.js":"","desktop/preload.js":"","dyn/collector.ps1":"","dyn/README-dinamik.md":"","dyn/statscan-dyn.js":""}}